{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Grave Stone is a decorative piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"]," that can be purchased from ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],"'s stand at the ",["l","万灵节","Spirit's Eve"]," festival for 350g or on ",["l","冬季","Winter 15"]," from the ",["l","夜市","Magic Shop Boat"]," at the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]," for 200g. It can be won from the Crane Game inside the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"],", during Fall."]],["p",["It may be placed anywhere in ",["l","Stardew Valley","Stardew Valley"],", indoors or out."]]]]]}